Background copy (version 1.2 build 54 release).
01.04.2004.
Background Copy is a plugin for FAR Manager to perform
file(s) view/edit/copy/move/delete/run with Unicode support.
Also copy/move/delete can be performed in the background
and work unattendedly, trying to complete as much work as
they can.

Windows NT/2000/XP only.

